<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Development - 分类 - DebugTalk</title><link>https://debugtalk.com/categories/Development/</link><description>DebugTalk</description><generator>Hugo 0.167.0 &amp; FixIt v1.0.0-beta-mukxzari</generator><language>zh-CN</language><managingEditor>mail@debugtalk.com (debugtalk)</managingEditor><webMaster>mail@debugtalk.com (debugtalk)</webMaster><lastBuildDate>Tue, 06 Oct 2026 11:40:44 +0000</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://debugtalk.com/categories/Development/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>How to install a package from Github that has other github dependencies ?</title><link>https://debugtalk.com/post/How-to-install-a-package-from-Github-that-has-other-github-dependencies/</link><pubDate>Sat, 05 Aug 2017 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><author>mail@debugtalk.com (debugtalk)</author><guid>https://debugtalk.com/post/How-to-install-a-package-from-Github-that-has-other-github-dependencies/</guid><category domain="https://debugtalk.com/categories/Development/">Development</category><description>&lt;p&gt;最近在开发&lt;code&gt;ApiTestEngine&lt;/code&gt;时遇到一个安装包依赖的问题，耗费了不少时间寻找解决方案，考虑到还算比较有普遍性，因此总结形成这篇文章。&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;h2 class="heading-element" id="从-pip-install-说起"&gt;&lt;span&gt;从 pip install 说起&lt;/span&gt;&#10; &lt;a href="#%e4%bb%8e-pip-install-%e8%af%b4%e8%b5%b7" class="heading-mark"&gt;&lt;svg class="octicon octicon-link" viewBox="0 0 16 16" version="1.1" width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;path d="m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z"&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;先不那么简单地描述下背景。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>解决 Jenkins 中无法展示 HTML 样式的问题</title><link>https://debugtalk.com/post/solve-Jenkins-can-not-show-html-css/</link><pubDate>Mon, 24 Jul 2017 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><author>mail@debugtalk.com (debugtalk)</author><guid>https://debugtalk.com/post/solve-Jenkins-can-not-show-html-css/</guid><category domain="https://debugtalk.com/categories/Development/">Development</category><description>&lt;h2 class="heading-element" id="问题描述"&gt;&lt;span&gt;问题描述&lt;/span&gt;&#10; &lt;a href="#%e9%97%ae%e9%a2%98%e6%8f%8f%e8%bf%b0" class="heading-mark"&gt;&lt;svg class="octicon octicon-link" viewBox="0 0 16 16" version="1.1" width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;path d="m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z"&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;对于测试报告来说，除了内容的简洁精炼，样式的美观也很重要。常用的做法是，采用&lt;code&gt;HTML&lt;/code&gt;格式的文档，并搭配&lt;code&gt;CSS&lt;/code&gt;和&lt;code&gt;JS&lt;/code&gt;，实现自定义的样式和动画效果（例如展开、折叠等）。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>使用 pyenv 管理多个 Python 版本依赖环境</title><link>https://debugtalk.com/post/use-pyenv-manage-multiple-python-virtualenvs/</link><pubDate>Sat, 25 Mar 2017 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><author>mail@debugtalk.com (debugtalk)</author><guid>https://debugtalk.com/post/use-pyenv-manage-multiple-python-virtualenvs/</guid><category domain="https://debugtalk.com/categories/Development/">Development</category><description>&lt;h2 class="heading-element" id="背景"&gt;&lt;span&gt;背景&lt;/span&gt;&#10; &lt;a href="#%e8%83%8c%e6%99%af" class="heading-mark"&gt;&lt;svg class="octicon octicon-link" viewBox="0 0 16 16" version="1.1" width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;path d="m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z"&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;从接触Python以来，一直都是采用&lt;a href="https://virtualenv.pypa.io/en/stable/" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener noreferrer"&gt;&lt;code&gt;virtualenv&lt;/code&gt;&lt;i class="fa-solid fa-external-link-alt fa-xs ms-1 text-secondary" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/a&gt;和&lt;a href="https://pypi.python.org/pypi/virtualenvwrapper" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener noreferrer"&gt;&lt;code&gt;virtualenvwrapper&lt;/code&gt;&lt;i class="fa-solid fa-external-link-alt fa-xs ms-1 text-secondary" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/a&gt;来管理不同项目的依赖环境，通过&lt;code&gt;workon&lt;/code&gt;、&lt;code&gt;mkvirtualenv&lt;/code&gt;等命令进行虚拟环境切换，很是愉快。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>【GIT技巧】清除历史提交记录中的敏感信息</title><link>https://debugtalk.com/post/clean-sensitive-data-from-git-history-commits/</link><pubDate>Fri, 17 Mar 2017 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><author>mail@debugtalk.com (debugtalk)</author><guid>https://debugtalk.com/post/clean-sensitive-data-from-git-history-commits/</guid><category domain="https://debugtalk.com/categories/Development/">Development</category><description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;a class="lightgallery" target="_blank" href="https://debugtalk.com/image/GitHub_hacker.jpg" title="/image/GitHub_hacker.jpg" data-thumbnail="/image/GitHub_hacker.jpg" data-sub-html="&lt;h2&gt;/image/GitHub_hacker.jpg&lt;/h2&gt;"&gt;&lt;img loading="lazy" src='https://debugtalk.com/image/GitHub_hacker.jpg' alt="/image/GitHub_hacker.jpg"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;h2 class="heading-element" id="背景介绍"&gt;&lt;span&gt;背景介绍&lt;/span&gt;&#10; &lt;a href="#%e8%83%8c%e6%99%af%e4%bb%8b%e7%bb%8d" class="heading-mark"&gt;&lt;svg class="octicon octicon-link" viewBox="0 0 16 16" version="1.1" width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;path d="m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z"&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;在使用GitHub的过程中，假如某次提交代码时不小心将密码或&lt;code&gt;SSH-key&lt;/code&gt;提交进了公共仓库。当然，希望这种事情永远也不会发生，但是如果真遇到了，该怎么办呢？&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>如何优雅地一键实现 macOS 网络代理切换</title><link>https://debugtalk.com/post/switch-macOS-web-proxy-in-elegant-way/</link><pubDate>Thu, 24 Nov 2016 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><author>mail@debugtalk.com (debugtalk)</author><guid>https://debugtalk.com/post/switch-macOS-web-proxy-in-elegant-way/</guid><category domain="https://debugtalk.com/categories/Development/">Development</category><description>&lt;p&gt;在&lt;code&gt;macOS&lt;/code&gt;中配置Web代理时，通常的做法是在控制面板中进行操作，&lt;code&gt;System Preferences&lt;/code&gt; -&amp;gt; &lt;code&gt;Network&lt;/code&gt; -&amp;gt; &lt;code&gt;Advanced&lt;/code&gt; -&amp;gt; &lt;code&gt;Proxies&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a class="lightgallery" target="_blank" href="https://debugtalk.com/image/macOS-Web-Proxy-Setting.jpg" title="macOS-Web-Proxy-Setting" data-thumbnail="/image/macOS-Web-Proxy-Setting.jpg" data-sub-html="&lt;h2&gt;macOS-Web-Proxy-Setting&lt;/h2&gt;"&gt;&lt;img loading="lazy" src='https://debugtalk.com/image/macOS-Web-Proxy-Setting.jpg' alt="macOS-Web-Proxy-Setting"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;这种配置方式虽然可以实现需求，但缺点在于操作比较繁琐，特别是在需要频繁切换的情况下，效率极其低下。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Jenkins 的输出日志也可以变得色色的</title><link>https://debugtalk.com/post/make-Jenkins-Console-Output-Colorful/</link><pubDate>Mon, 15 Aug 2016 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><author>mail@debugtalk.com (debugtalk)</author><guid>https://debugtalk.com/post/make-Jenkins-Console-Output-Colorful/</guid><category domain="https://debugtalk.com/categories/Development/">Development</category><description>&lt;p&gt;在《&lt;a href="https://debugtalk.com/post/Jenkins-CI-Automation-Test/"&gt;使用Jenkins实现持续集成构建检查&lt;/a&gt;》一文中，写到了这么一段话：&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;blockquote&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;在这里，我们还可以通过&amp;ndash;disable_output_color开关将输出日志的颜色关闭。之所以实现这么一个功能，是因为在Jenkins中本来也无法显示颜色，但是如果还将Terminal中有颜色的日志内容输出到Jenkins中，就会出现一些额外的字符，比较影响日志的美观。&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;/blockquote&gt;</description></item><item><title>使用 Jenkins 实现持续集成构建检查</title><link>https://debugtalk.com/post/Jenkins-CI-Automation-Test/</link><pubDate>Sun, 14 Aug 2016 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><author>mail@debugtalk.com (debugtalk)</author><guid>https://debugtalk.com/post/Jenkins-CI-Automation-Test/</guid><category domain="https://debugtalk.com/categories/Development/">Development</category><description>&lt;p&gt;通过&lt;a href="https://debugtalk.com/post/iOS-Android-Packing-with-Jenkins/"&gt;《使用Jenkins搭建iOS/Android持续集成打包平台》&lt;/a&gt;和&lt;a href="https://debugtalk.com/post/iOS-Android-Packing-with-Jenkins-details/"&gt;《关于持续集成打包平台的Jenkins配置和构建脚本实现细节》&lt;/a&gt;两篇文章，我们已经在原理概念和实践操作两个层面掌握了如何搭建一个完整的持续集成打包平台。&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;不过，在实际使用过程中，发现有时候还会存在一个问题。研发同学提交新的代码后，Jenkins端可以成功执行构建，并生成安装包；然而在将安装包安装至移动设备时，却发现有时候会出现无法成功安装，或者安装后出现启动闪退的情况。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>关于持续集成打包平台的 Jenkins 配置和构建脚本实现细节</title><link>https://debugtalk.com/post/iOS-Android-Packing-with-Jenkins-details/</link><pubDate>Tue, 26 Jul 2016 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><author>mail@debugtalk.com (debugtalk)</author><guid>https://debugtalk.com/post/iOS-Android-Packing-with-Jenkins-details/</guid><category domain="https://debugtalk.com/categories/Development/">Development</category><description>&lt;p&gt;在&lt;a href="https://debugtalk.com/post/iOS-Android-Packing-with-Jenkins/"&gt;《使用Jenkins搭建iOS/Android持续集成打包平台》&lt;/a&gt;一文中，我对如何使用Jenkins搭建iOS/Android持续集成打包平台的基础概念和实施流程进行了介绍。本文作为配套，对搭建持续集成打包平台中涉及到的执行命令、构建脚本（build.py），以及Jenkins的配置进行详细的补充说明。&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;当然，如果你不关心技术实现细节，也可以完全不用理会，直接参照【开箱即用】部分按照步骤进行操作即可。&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;h2 class="heading-element" id="关于ios的构建"&gt;&lt;span&gt;关于iOS的构建&lt;/span&gt;&#10; &lt;a href="#%e5%85%b3%e4%ba%8eios%e7%9a%84%e6%9e%84%e5%bb%ba" class="heading-mark"&gt;&lt;svg class="octicon octicon-link" viewBox="0 0 16 16" version="1.1" width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;path d="m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z"&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;对iOS源码进行构建，目标是要生成&lt;code&gt;.ipa&lt;/code&gt;文件，即iOS应用安装包。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>使用 Jenkins 搭建 iOS/Android 持续集成打包平台</title><link>https://debugtalk.com/post/iOS-Android-Packing-with-Jenkins/</link><pubDate>Tue, 28 Jun 2016 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><author>mail@debugtalk.com (debugtalk)</author><guid>https://debugtalk.com/post/iOS-Android-Packing-with-Jenkins/</guid><category domain="https://debugtalk.com/categories/Development/">Development</category><description>&lt;h2 class="heading-element" id="背景描述"&gt;&lt;span&gt;背景描述&lt;/span&gt;&#10; &lt;a href="#%e8%83%8c%e6%99%af%e6%8f%8f%e8%bf%b0" class="heading-mark"&gt;&lt;svg class="octicon octicon-link" viewBox="0 0 16 16" version="1.1" width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;path d="m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z"&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;根据项目需求，现要在团队内部搭建一个统一的打包平台，实现对iOS和Android项目的打包。而且为了方便团队内部的测试包分发，希望在打包完成后能生成一个二维码，体验用户（产品、运营、测试等人员）通过手机扫描二维码后就能直接安装测试包。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>深入浅出 Git 权限校验</title><link>https://debugtalk.com/post/head-first-git-authority-verification/</link><pubDate>Wed, 15 Jun 2016 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><author>mail@debugtalk.com (debugtalk)</author><guid>https://debugtalk.com/post/head-first-git-authority-verification/</guid><category domain="https://debugtalk.com/categories/Development/">Development</category><description>&lt;p&gt;借助上次“掉坑”的经历，我对Git权限校验的两种方式重头进行了梳理，形成了这篇总结记录。&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;在本地计算机与GitHub（或GitLab）进行通信时，传输主要基于两种协议，&lt;code&gt;HTTPS&lt;/code&gt;和&lt;code&gt;SSH&lt;/code&gt;，对应的仓库地址就是&lt;code&gt;HTTPS URLs&lt;/code&gt;和&lt;code&gt;SSH URLs&lt;/code&gt;。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>GitHub 权限校验失败给我的启发</title><link>https://debugtalk.com/post/trap-in-GitHub-authority-verification/</link><pubDate>Tue, 14 Jun 2016 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><author>mail@debugtalk.com (debugtalk)</author><guid>https://debugtalk.com/post/trap-in-GitHub-authority-verification/</guid><category domain="https://debugtalk.com/categories/Development/">Development</category><description>&lt;h2 class="heading-element" id="背景描述"&gt;&lt;span&gt;背景描述&lt;/span&gt;&#10; &lt;a href="#%e8%83%8c%e6%99%af%e6%8f%8f%e8%bf%b0" class="heading-mark"&gt;&lt;svg class="octicon octicon-link" viewBox="0 0 16 16" version="1.1" width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;path d="m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z"&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;众所周知，在GitHub中，每个仓库都有两个地址，分别基于&lt;code&gt;HTTPS&lt;/code&gt;协议和&lt;code&gt;SSH&lt;/code&gt;协议，两个协议对应的URL地址（repository_url）形式如下所示：&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>敏捷团队协作：Confluence简易教程</title><link>https://debugtalk.com/post/confluence-simple-tutorial/</link><pubDate>Tue, 07 Jun 2016 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><author>mail@debugtalk.com (debugtalk)</author><guid>https://debugtalk.com/post/confluence-simple-tutorial/</guid><category domain="https://debugtalk.com/categories/Development/">Development</category><description>&lt;h2 class="heading-element" id="0confluence简介"&gt;&lt;span&gt;0、Confluence简介&lt;/span&gt;&#10; &lt;a href="#0confluence%e7%ae%80%e4%bb%8b" class="heading-mark"&gt;&lt;svg class="octicon octicon-link" viewBox="0 0 16 16" version="1.1" width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;path d="m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z"&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Confluence是一个企业级的Wiki软件，可用于在企业、部门、团队内部进行信息共享和协同编辑。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>通过 API 远程管理 Jenkins</title><link>https://debugtalk.com/post/manage-Jenkins-via-remote-api/</link><pubDate>Mon, 02 May 2016 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><author>mail@debugtalk.com (debugtalk)</author><guid>https://debugtalk.com/post/manage-Jenkins-via-remote-api/</guid><category domain="https://debugtalk.com/categories/Development/">Development</category><description>&lt;h2 class="heading-element" id="背景介绍"&gt;&lt;span&gt;背景介绍&lt;/span&gt;&#10; &lt;a href="#%e8%83%8c%e6%99%af%e4%bb%8b%e7%bb%8d" class="heading-mark"&gt;&lt;svg class="octicon octicon-link" viewBox="0 0 16 16" version="1.1" width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;path d="m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z"&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;最近接到一个需求，需要对公司内部的Android性能测试平台的分支管理模块进行改造。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>SQL语句中关于NULL的那些坑</title><link>https://debugtalk.com/post/traps-in-sql-null/</link><pubDate>Mon, 25 Apr 2016 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><author>mail@debugtalk.com (debugtalk)</author><guid>https://debugtalk.com/post/traps-in-sql-null/</guid><category domain="https://debugtalk.com/categories/Development/">Development</category><description>&lt;h2 class="heading-element" id="问题描述"&gt;&lt;span&gt;问题描述&lt;/span&gt;&#10; &lt;a href="#%e9%97%ae%e9%a2%98%e6%8f%8f%e8%bf%b0" class="heading-mark"&gt;&lt;svg class="octicon octicon-link" viewBox="0 0 16 16" version="1.1" width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;path d="m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z"&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;今天在跟进公司内部测试平台线上问题的时候，发现一个忽略已久的问题。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Python 的函数式编程 -- 从入门到⎡放弃⎦</title><link>https://debugtalk.com/post/python-functional-programming-getting-started/</link><pubDate>Fri, 08 Apr 2016 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><author>mail@debugtalk.com (debugtalk)</author><guid>https://debugtalk.com/post/python-functional-programming-getting-started/</guid><category domain="https://debugtalk.com/categories/Development/">Development</category><description>&lt;p&gt;很早以前就听说过了函数式编程，印象中是一种很晦涩难懂的编程模式，但却一直没有去进行了解。&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;恰好这周组内的周会轮到我主持，一时也没想到要分享什么。灵光一闪，就选定函数式编程这个主题吧，反正组里的同事都没有学过，只需要讲解入门方面的知识就好，也正好可以借这个机会逼迫自己去学习下这种新的编程方式。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>测试结果报表展现：Web页面绘制多层级表格</title><link>https://debugtalk.com/post/render-multi-level-table-in-webpage/</link><pubDate>Sun, 20 Mar 2016 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><author>mail@debugtalk.com (debugtalk)</author><guid>https://debugtalk.com/post/render-multi-level-table-in-webpage/</guid><category domain="https://debugtalk.com/categories/Development/">Development</category><description>&lt;h2 class="heading-element" id="背景描述"&gt;&lt;span&gt;背景描述&lt;/span&gt;&#10; &lt;a href="#%e8%83%8c%e6%99%af%e6%8f%8f%e8%bf%b0" class="heading-mark"&gt;&lt;svg class="octicon octicon-link" viewBox="0 0 16 16" version="1.1" width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;path d="m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z"&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;在Android性能测试中，每一个测试任务都对应了1个测试用例、1台测试设备、一个测试包，并且在测试结果中包含了多个指标项。通常，我们希望能对两个不同版本测试包的测试结果进行对比，并能在Web页面上以表格的形式进行展现。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>【灵感】线上数据采摘工具（ProductionDataPicker）</title><link>https://debugtalk.com/post/developing-idea-production-data-picker/</link><pubDate>Tue, 08 Mar 2016 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><author>mail@debugtalk.com (debugtalk)</author><guid>https://debugtalk.com/post/developing-idea-production-data-picker/</guid><category domain="https://debugtalk.com/categories/Development/">Development</category><description>&lt;h2 class="heading-element" id="背景"&gt;&lt;span&gt;背景&lt;/span&gt;&#10; &lt;a href="#%e8%83%8c%e6%99%af" class="heading-mark"&gt;&lt;svg class="octicon octicon-link" viewBox="0 0 16 16" version="1.1" width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;path d="m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z"&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;不管是是研发同学还是测试同学，日常跟进线上问题时对如下两个场景应该都很熟悉：&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>利用 PyCharm 进行 Python 远程调试</title><link>https://debugtalk.com/post/remote-debugging-with-pycharm/</link><pubDate>Mon, 13 Jul 2015 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><author>mail@debugtalk.com (debugtalk)</author><guid>https://debugtalk.com/post/remote-debugging-with-pycharm/</guid><category domain="https://debugtalk.com/categories/Development/">Development</category><description>&lt;h2 class="heading-element" id="背景描述"&gt;&lt;span&gt;背景描述&lt;/span&gt;&#10; &lt;a href="#%e8%83%8c%e6%99%af%e6%8f%8f%e8%bf%b0" class="heading-mark"&gt;&lt;svg class="octicon octicon-link" viewBox="0 0 16 16" version="1.1" width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;path d="m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z"&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;有时候Python应用的代码在本地开发环境运行十分正常，但是放到线上以后却出现了莫名其妙的异常，经过再三排查以后还是找不到问题原因，于是就在想，要是可以在服务器环境中进行单步跟踪调试就好了。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>HTML 字符实体(Character Entity)</title><link>https://debugtalk.com/post/html-character-entity/</link><pubDate>Fri, 04 Oct 2013 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><author>mail@debugtalk.com (debugtalk)</author><guid>https://debugtalk.com/post/html-character-entity/</guid><category domain="https://debugtalk.com/categories/Development/">Development</category><description>&lt;h2 class="heading-element" id="字符实体的由来"&gt;&lt;span&gt;字符实体的由来&lt;/span&gt;&#10; &lt;a href="#%e5%ad%97%e7%ac%a6%e5%ae%9e%e4%bd%93%e7%9a%84%e7%94%b1%e6%9d%a5" class="heading-mark"&gt;&lt;svg class="octicon octicon-link" viewBox="0 0 16 16" version="1.1" width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;path d="m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z"&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;在HTML源文件中，有些字符（如&amp;lt;，&amp;gt;，&amp;amp;等）作为特殊字符不能直接使用，如果直接使用的话HTML将不能被正确解析。但如果HTML内容中需要展示这些特殊字符时该怎么处理呢？这就需要使用转义字符串来对其进行转义。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>